://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/836#issuecomment-483823459","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/836","id":483823459,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ4MzgyMzQ1OQ==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-04-16T20:06:16Z","updated_at":"2019-04-16T20:06:16Z","body":"I've come across this periodically in the wild, in some cases for works that moved to CC0 for later versions, but used this public domain statement for earlier releases. As the submitter noted, this seems reasonably comparable to something like The Unlicense. \r\n\r\nI think this is appropriate to include on the License List, even though Creative Commons has retired it and doesn't recommend it for new works going forward.\r\n\r\nMy only comment is that we might want to use the name \"Public Domain Certification\" and the short identifier \"CC-PDC\". It appears that Creative Commons separately has a \"Public Domain Mark\" option, see https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/, and we should probably make sure the name + identifier align to the old tool.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/483823459/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/483844035","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/836#issuecomment-483844035","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/836","id":483844035,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ4Mzg0NDAzNQ==","user":{"login":"mlinksva","id":40415,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNDE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40415?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva","html_url":"https://github.com/mlinksva","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlinksva/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2019-04-16T21:08:09Z","updated_at":"2019-04-16T21:08:09Z","body":"If not CC-PD I would recommend CC-PDDC. It started as a dedication only https://web.archive.org/web/20021222174155/creativecommons.org/licenses/publicdomain but was  characterized as a dedication and certification early on https://web.archive.org/web/20040402125107/http://creativecommons.org/licenses/publicdomain/ and referred to as CC-PDDC various places eg https://wiki.creativecommons.org/wiki/PDM_FAQ#What_about_CC.E2.80.99s_Public_Domain_Dedication_and_Certification.3F_Can_that_tool_still_be_used.3F","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/483844035/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/483869156","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/836#issuecomment-483869156","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/836","id":483869156,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ4Mzg2OTE1Ng==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-04-16T22:35:35Z","updated_at":"2019-04-16T22:35:35Z","body":"@mlinksva Thanks for the background -- this is very helpful. Agreed, CC-PDDC sounds like a good choice for the ID here.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/com